    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21097" root="سهم" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُهُومٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of 1. (S, &amp;c.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>A frowning</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُبُوسٌ</span>, K, TA) <i>of the face by reason of anxiety.</i>
(TA. [In the CK, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّهُومُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَبُوسُ</span> are erroneously put for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السُّهُومُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العُبُوسُ</span>: in the TA,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السهوم</span> is expressly said to be with damm, in this
case, and the meaning is shown by two verses
there cited.])

